WEBVTT

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:05.260
You finish a project, send the invoice, and
realize you need to find the next client

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.214
all over again.

00:00:06.354 --> 00:00:07.444
The work is good.

00:00:07.584 --> 00:00:09.770
The path to the next sale is unclear.

00:00:10.378 --> 00:00:13.760
Maybe you coach people who keep asking for
free advice.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.341
Maybe your videos get views but brands
rarely inquire.

00:00:17.481 --> 00:00:21.873
Or you design solid work, send custom
quotes, and hear nothing back.

00:00:22.503 --> 00:00:25.548
Start by asking where people stop moving
forward.

00:00:25.688 --> 00:00:26.969
How do they find you?

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:29.308
What happens after they show interest?

00:00:29.498 --> 00:00:30.906
Do they know what to buy?

00:00:31.096 --> 00:00:33.842
And once the work is done, what happens
next?

00:00:34.503 --> 00:00:37.613
The Authority Flywheel gives each step a
job.

00:00:37.753 --> 00:00:40.419
Attract the right people with useful
content.

00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:42.939
Engage them with a follow-up that helps.

00:00:43.079 --> 00:00:45.939
Convert qualified prospects with a clear
offer.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:50.834
Ascend by turning good delivery into repeat
work, referrals, and proof.

00:00:51.462 --> 00:00:55.836
Picture a designer who posts a packaging
teardown and shares a brief.

00:00:55.976 --> 00:01:00.307
A founder downloads it, sees a useful
example, and books a fit call.

00:01:00.447 --> 00:01:04.853
After delivery, an approved
before-and-after becomes the next teardown.

00:01:04.993 --> 00:01:06.035
That is the loop.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:12.245
Inside the playbook you get three worked
service businesses, five complete emails to

00:01:12.245 --> 00:01:17.392
adapt, a sales call script, four
worksheets, and a 30-day build plan.

00:01:18.003 --> 00:01:19.958
This is not a get-rich-quick scheme.

00:01:20.098 --> 00:01:23.816
You will need to talk to buyers, publish
the work, and follow up.

00:01:23.956 --> 00:01:28.416
The system gives each of those efforts a
place and something you can improve.

00:01:29.045 --> 00:01:33.849
If you want to find your starting point
first, take the free diagnostic below.

00:01:33.989 --> 00:01:38.965
When you are ready to build, get the
Authority Flywheel Playbook for fifteen

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:40.114
thousand Rwandan francs.

